<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CFX Corp started as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CFX Corp started as a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of CFX Corp with a buy recommenation.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 16 in morning American Stock Exchange trade.</p>
